-          <h1>The Print</h1>
-          <div class="card-real">MGC 08:30 Data Fade</div>
-          <span class="pdp-note">MGC · 08:30 ET — the gold data-release fade</span>
-        </div>
-        <div class="pdp-hero"><b>750%</b><span>return on max drawdown &middot; best window</span>
-          <em class="pdp-hero-sub">$37,500 on a $5,000 drawdown</em></div>
